{"indicator":"diversity","unit":"","years":[2010,2020],"notes":{"TWN":"Pew 把台灣的民間信仰與道教歸在「其他宗教」（2020 年約 52%），佛教徒約 19%、無宗教信仰約 23%、基督徒約 6%。很多人同時拜佛、拜神、祭祖，用單一宗教分類只是近似。內政部宗教統計：2025 年底登記的寺廟 12,397 座（道教 9,824、佛教 2,277、一貫道 243），教會（堂）2,855 座（基督教 2,373、天主教 429）；民間信仰多半沒有登記入教，內政部沒有各宗教的信徒比例。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"Pew counts Taiwan's folk religion and Taoism as \"other religions\" (about 52% in 2020); about 19% are Buddhist, 23% unaffiliated and 6% Christian. Many people worship at Buddhist and folk temples and venerate ancestors at the same time, so a single religion is only an approximation. Ministry of the Interior religious statistics: at the end of 2025 there were 12,397 registered temples (Taoist 9,824, Buddhist 2,277, Yiguandao 243) and 2,855 churches (Protestant 2,373, Catholic 429); most folk-religion believers are not registered, so the ministry has no figures on the share of believers."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-2,898,-1]},"values":{"AFG":[-2,6,-3],"ALB":[-2,534,-59],"DZA":[-2,33,4],"AGO":[-2,184,-32],"ARG":[-2,251,-7],"ARM":[-2,57,5],"ABW":[-2,360,15],"AUS":[-2,567,132],"AUT":[-2,387,171],"AZE":[-2,66,51],"BHS":[-2,57,-2],"BHR":[-2,543,-52],"BGD":[-2,205,-13],"BRB":[-2,431,-10],"BLR":[-2,136,163],"BEL":[-2,608,72],"BLZ":[-2,488,-5],"BEN":[-2,681,24],"BTN":[-2,456,-1],"BOL":[-2,96,137],"BIH":[-2,608,-10],"BWA":[-2,385,-34],"BRA":[-2,231,152],"BRN":[-2,425,-57],"BGR":[-2,374,31],"BFA":[-2,593,-50],"BDI":[-2,104,9],"KHM":[-2,70,-4],"CMR":[-2,512,10],"CAN":[-2,570,121],"CPV":[-2,288,114],"CAF":[-2,218,-16],"TCD":[-2,601,17],"CHL":[-2,282,233],"CHN":[-2,269,-43],"COL":[-2,164,122],"COM":[-2,11,28],"CRI":[-2,189,65],"HRV":[-2,141,57],"CUB":[-2,664,-16],"CUW":[-2,203,1],"CYP":[-2,578,-21],"CZE":[-2,513,-46],"COD":[-2,80,5],"DNK":[-2,391,51],"DJI":[-2,59,-6],"DOM":[-2,299,119],"ECU":[-2,99,144],"EGY":[-2,113,-6],"SLV":[-2,240,25],"GNQ":[-2,244,0],"ERI":[-2,601,0],"EST":[-2,609,12],"SWZ":[-2,152,-4],"ETH":[-2,568,3],"FSM":[-2,28,0],"FJI":[-2,575,-44],"FIN":[-2,353